u a disposição. \n\nConto com a colaboração de todas. Obrigada!',NULL,'text',NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:26:32',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-10 20:26:32',0),(41851,106,17,'private','ei taiane',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:27:30',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-10 20:27:30',0),(41852,101,10,'group','👍🏻',NULL,'text',NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:27:41',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-10 20:27:41',0),(41853,106,9,'private','Luiz Felipe dos Santos',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:28:47',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-10 20:28:47',0),(41854,73,19,'private','Boa tarde, Camila.\nA Dra. me orientou que pedisse para você elaborar um documento referente a cortesia, para que a prof. Elda possa assinar, pois vou dar seguimento com a visita escolar do filho dela que será cortesia.',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:29:24',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-10 20:29:24',0),(41855,9,6,'private','Tem algumas guias suas aguardando documentação no 04 e 44 do Servir',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:30:56',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-10 20:30:56',0),(41856,31,3,'group','1773080660746-Parecer___JO__O_VICTOR__assinado.pdf',NULL,'file','1773175004989-1773080660746_Parecer___JO__O_VICTOR__assinado.pdf',0,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:36:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-10 20:36:45',0),(41857,3,52,'private','Boa tarde',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:39:01',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-10 20:39:01',0),(41858,1,19,'private','Ta ficando bonito o sistema de vcs',NULL,'file','1773175505565-image.png',1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:45:05',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-10 20:45:05',0),(41859,1,19,'private','image.png',NULL,'file','1773175523733-image.png',1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:45:23',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-10 20:45:23',0),(41860,1,19,'private','Ainda falta arrumar umas coisas. ',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:45:29',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-10 20:45:29',0),(41861,6,9,'private','Irei verificar ',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-03-10 17:45:49',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03