mento e gerando atraso.  E apenas na recepção da unidade 1.',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,1,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 10:53:42',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 13:53:42',0),(83468,72,124,'private','Pode marcar ',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 10:53:51',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 13:53:51',0),(83469,124,72,'private','Obrigada',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 10:53:56',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 13:53:56',0),(83470,72,124,'private','Bom dia ',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 10:54:01',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 13:54:01',0),(83471,4,7,'private','martha falou que não tem nenhuma geap na recepção',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,1,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 10:54:44',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 13:54:44',0),(83472,4,7,'private','🤡',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 10:54:56',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 13:54:56',0),(83473,29,101,'private','agendado',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 10:55:02',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 13:55:02',0),(83474,7,4,'private','🤡🤡',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 10:55:12',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 13:55:12',0),(83475,29,101,'private','essa reunião é do setor com a doutora ?',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 10:57:08',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 13:57:08',0),(83476,7,112,'private','Bom dia',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 10:57:51',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 13:57:51',0),(83477,7,112,'private','Arthur Antonio Martins dos Santos - Vai ser agendado para TCC?',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 10:58:03',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 13:58:03',0),(83478,20,110,'private','Eu transferi pro faturamento, não sabia em quem ia cair',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 11:00:56',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 14:00:56',0),(83479,48,73,'private','ciente',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-02 11:01:15',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 14:01:15',0),(83480,73,43,'private','Raissa, responsável do Emanuel Carvalho Vaz entrou em contato pelo WhatsApp. Consegue verificar a demanda dela?',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-0