 e a segurança emocional da criança.”',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-29 17:04:36',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:04:36',1),(98110,32,79,'private','Para Alexia, o roteiro da vitória','Thays','text',NULL,1,0,0,0,98109,'2026-06-29 17:04:59',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:04:59',0),(98111,39,73,'private','Pode deixar',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-29 17:05:05',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:05:05',0),(98112,124,76,'private','Boa tarde',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-29 17:06:12',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:06:12',0),(98113,20,23,'private','Sarah da Silva Ferreira saiu da agenda por isso não pegamos o ultimo token',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-29 17:06:27',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:06:27',0),(98114,124,76,'private','Tudo bem? a cabeça parou de doer?',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-29 17:06:33',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:06:33',0),(98115,20,23,'private','Aimee o pai não passar o token de jeito nenhum ',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-29 17:06:51',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:06:51',0),(98116,20,23,'private','Bernardo Henrique é o caso que o pai também não responde as mensagens já tinha enviado essa demanda para Ester',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-29 17:07:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:07:46',0),(98117,73,39,'private','*ALTERAÇÃO*\n\n16:40 - Samira Rickson, 16 anos - Andréa ',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-29 17:08:25',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:08:25',0),(98118,73,126,'private','*ALTERAÇÃO*\n\n16:40 - Samira Rickson, 16 anos - Andréa ',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-29 17:08:33',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:08:33',0),(98119,73,41,'private','*ALTERAÇÃO*\n\n16:40 - Samira Rickson, 16 anos - Andréa ',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-29 17:08:41',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:08:41',0),(98120,130,73,'private','Acho que a Karine já falou com vc, né. Sobre o Wilson. ',NULL,'text',NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,'2026-06-29 17:08:43',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 20:08:43',0),(98121,122,45,'private'